  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping study ICT sector Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the Armenian ICT sector, by assessing the sector and it&apos;s opportunities, challenges, gaps and problems.This will lead to business leads for project interventions and will provide interested Dutch companies with comprehensive, up to date and relevant findings about the ICT sector in Armenia.The Netherlands embassy in Yerevan, Armenia has received a comprehensive study, which will enable them to initiate future interventions in the form of the projects.Furthermore, it enables them to contribute to the development of the business ties between Armenia and the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
